{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは\n皆既月食みようと何度も試みたけどどこ探しても月がありませんでした🌚なるほどこれが怪奇月食🌚\n佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PD1D9V1F4DDWSCFXP0QD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PE3H8NDG8B18Q03GSPC3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PF3BT6ST8MVABY8B57V7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PG2QN795MAJX8XB8FEVR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"餃子屋さんのホール担当をイメージしてチャイナな服を着てみました🥡🥢ひよたんと餃子食べに行きたいな〜行きたいところあるんだよ〜ひよた〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PH42X23YMQMA51SJNW0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PJ4ASMQJJAPB328VBXMN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">チャイナ大量発生🤭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PK4107S6H0BGD7DSGVHV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PS37CARDD1042PZYB0S4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこれは違う日のミーグリ靴下もUNIQLOだったよ🧦UNIQLO×MARNI楽しみだなあ🤤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ今週末はツアーファイナル！最終日は配信もあるので是非🫶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PT35P9Z8J70A1H6D09X9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ40PV4AVJ19BPMJ08TXQBNG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nライブ恒例ステージ下の写真🫥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}